      "status": "stated-only",
      "notes": "The claim that a machine finds every stacked name left the tree on 2026-07-28, when docs/language-defects.md was rewritten as the record of where the rules came from; nothing states the machine in the present tense now, so this entry reads stated-only. The owner's example, asked of a stacked name in a hook's own text (2026-07-27 17:27): «\"chat-law reminder\" это что за ассоциативный ряд?»",
